{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0081-s001", "text": "Personbeteckningen är en individuell kod som ges till alla människor som registreras i Finlands befolkningsdatasystem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0081-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.3768310546875, "generation_seconds": 37.848541704937816, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0081-s002", "text": "Registreringen baserar sig i allmänhet på att man bor i Finland eller har finskt medborgarskap.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0081-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.302978515625, "generation_seconds": 35.06522699003108, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s001", "text": "Två personer kan aldrig ha samma personbeteckning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.3978271484375, "generation_seconds": 21.005649210885167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s002", "text": "Med hjälp av personbeteckningen kan människor alltså identifieras, även om de skulle ha exakt samma namn och födelsedatum.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.866938775510205, "peak": 0.31317138671875, "generation_seconds": 35.54237766005099, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s003", "text": "När man en gång har fått en personbeteckning förblir den för alltid densamma, förutom i vissa undantagsfall.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.360809326171875, "generation_seconds": 28.912547311047092, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s004", "text": "Även om man skulle flytta från Finland och bo utomlands i flera år eller årtionden, förblir personbeteckningen densamma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.297943115234375, "generation_seconds": 35.58120021992363, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s005", "text": "Med hjälp av personbeteckningen kan myndigheterna säkerställa att uppgifter kopplas till rätt person.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.27667236328125, "generation_seconds": 24.369216585997492, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0082-s006", "text": "Också många privata aktörer såsom banker använder personbeteckningen för att identifiera människor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T073603798202+0000-1/hb-c12-u0082-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.435272216796875, "generation_seconds": 30.771589195122942, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
